// Data/levels.json
//
// All level definitions for any game built on this KPF template belong here.
// Keep layouts, objectives, spawns, and per-level tuning in this file —
// do not hard-code level content in index.html.
// Play order and endless looping live in Data/levelOrder.json (references levelId).
//
// Load with the full project-root path: "assets/Data/levels.json"
// (JSON with // comments — strip comments before JSON.parse, or use a JSONC loader.)
//
// Each level object MUST include a unique string levelId so order, saves, and
// analytics can identify which level is which. Example shape:
//
//   { "levelId": "level_01", /* layouts, objectives, spawns, tuning… */ }
//
// Replace the empty levels array with your level objects as the game is implemented.

{
  "levels": []
}
